    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d91">

                <pb facs="0155" n="147" sameAs="frus:frus1938v01/pg147"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">741.65/536a</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt
                        to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-04-18">April 18, 1938</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I have just read Halifax’s communication to Kennedy—and I suppose the last
                    paragraph needs some answer. Will you talk to me about this at your
                    convenience.</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
